          %h3#ConstructionForBasedLoopSpace For the based loop space
          %p
            The
            %a{:href => "#ConstructionForFreeLoopSpace"} above
            result for the Sullivan model of free loop spaces implies also the models for based loop spaces, as follows.
          %p
            For
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi X
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X
            a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pointed+topological+space"} pointed topological space
            and for the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/circle"} circle
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
