              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %msup
                      %mo ∧
                      %mo •
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi s
                    %mi V
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo ,
                    %msub
                      %mi d
                      %mrow
                        %mi Ω
                        %mi X
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (\wedge^\bullet( s V ), d_{\Omega X})
              of its
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/based+loop+space"} based loop space
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi Ω
                    %mi X
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Omega X
              is the dgc-algebra obtained from
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
