          %p
          #PontrjaginProductOnHomologyOfBasedLoopSpace.num_remark
            %h6 Remark
            %p
              While Prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#SullivanModelForBasedLoopSpace"}
              says that the rational
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Whitehead+brackets"} Whitehead brackets
              of a loop space all vanish (as generally for any
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/H-space"} H-space
              = succeed ")," do
                %a{:href => "H-space#RationalHomotopy"} there
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ordinary+homology"} ordinary homology
              of a loop space inherits another product, namely the
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pontrjagin+product"} Pontrjagin product
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "Pontrjagin+ring#RelationToWhiteheadProduct"} there
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/universal+enveloping+algebra"} universal enveloping algebra
              of the binary
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Whitehead+bracket"} Whitehead bracket
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/super+Lie+algebra"} super Lie algebra
              of the original space.
          %h2#properties Properties
          %h3#homotopy_quotient_by_
