              with respect to the canonical
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/circle+group"} circle group
              action that rotates loops (i.e. for the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Borel+construction"} Borel construction
              = succeed ")" do
