              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/linear+span"} linear span
              of their algebra generators is
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/linear+isomorphism"} linearly isomorphic
              to the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/rationalization"} rationalization
              of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+groups"} homotopy groups
              of the corresponding space. Since the Sullivan model for
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
